WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.208 --> 00:00:02.877
Announcer:
This might mark the final World Cup of Lionel Messi.

00:00:02.919 --> 00:00:04.879
♪♪

00:00:04.921 --> 00:00:07.298
Gary Lineker:
It was obvious that he was going to be great.

00:00:07.340 --> 00:00:09.050
It was just a question of how great.

00:00:09.092 --> 00:00:11.761
Announcer:
Messi has yet to secure the ultimate prize.

00:00:11.803 --> 00:00:13.263
 ♪♪

00:00:13.304 --> 00:00:14.556
It would be the dream ending.

00:00:14.597 --> 00:00:16.099
♪♪

00:00:16.141 --> 00:00:17.267
Messi:
To win the World Cup.

00:00:17.308 --> 00:00:18.476
♪♪

00:00:18.518 --> 00:00:22.021
Announcer:
Messi is Argentina. Argentina are Messi.

00:00:22.063 --> 00:00:26.484
♪♪

